    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ASK THE FLIGHT STEWARD\nOR THE FLIGHT HOSTESS\nQANTAS\nAUSTRALIA'S ROUND-THE-WORLD AIRLINE",
      "Sterling\n2\n6\nHONOLULU - LONDON\nMEXICO - LONDON\nPrices listed are minimum allowed by International\nAir Transport Association in this Area.\nBAR PRICES\nAustralian\nCents\ning U.S.A.\nAustralian\nCents\nCents\ng U.S.A.\nCents\nSterling\nS.\nBEER\nAustralian\nBEER\nAustralian\nSmall Bottle\nand other\n18\n20\nSmall Bottle\nand other\n22\n25\n2\nCan\nBrands\nCan\nBrands\nCOCKTAILS\nCOCKTAILS\nChampagne Cocktail\nGlass\nOthers\nGlass\n50\n28\n60\n30\nChampagne Cocktail\nGlass\nOthers\nGlass\n50\n45\n60\n50\nLIQUEURS\nLIQUEURS\nChoice\nMins.\n45\n50\nChoice\nMins.\n45\n50\n3\n3\nWINES\nWINES\nSweet Vermouth\nMins.\n28\n30\nSweet Vermouth\nMins.\n30\n35\n4\n2\nDry Vermouth\nMins.\nDry Vermouth\nMins.\nSelected Australian Wines:\nSelected Australian Wines:\nRed or White\nGlass\nSherry\nMins.\nChampagne\nGlass\n25\n18\n50\n30\n20\n60\nRed or White\nGlass\nSherry\nMins.\nChampagne\nGlass\n30\n25\n50\n35\n30\n60\nLIQUORS\nLIQUORS\nScotch Whisky\nMins.\nScotch Whisky\nMins.\nCanadian Rye Whisky\nMins.\nCanadian Rye Whisky\nMins.\nBourbon Whisky\nMins.\nBrandy\nMins.\n28\n30\nBourbon Whisky\nMins.\n30\n35\n2\n9\nBrandy\nMins.\nGin\nMins.\nGin\nMins.\nVodka\nMins.\nVodka\nMins.\nBacardi Rum\nMins.\nBacardi Rum\nMins.\nCIGARETTES\nCIGARETTES\nEnglish\nTins\nPkts.\n20\nTins\n20\nAustralian\n20\nPkts.\n20\n22\nEnglish\n25\nAustralian\nPkts.\n20\n22\n25\nAmerican\nAmerican\nPkts.\n20\nLuxury Length\nPkts.\n20\nMINERALS\n25\n30\nLuxury Length\nPkts.\n• 20\n25\n30\nMINERALS\nGinger Ale\nGinger Ale\nSoda Water\nTonic Water\nComplimentary\nSoda Water\nTonic Water\nComplimentary\nCoca-Cola\nCoca-Cola\nMinerals, Liquors, Wines and Beer are Complimentary to First Class Passengers\nOwing to weight restrictions, a limited stock only of the items quoted are on board, so on occasions some may not be available.\nDrinks and cigarettes can be purchased in flight in accordance with Customs and Excise limitations. This service is not available whenever there is\nneed for seat belts to be fastened.\nSUGGESTED COCKTAILS\nEXECUTIVE MARTINI\nA really dry Martini for the masculine\npalate.\n*\nCHAMPAGNE (Qantas Special)\nAn appetiser specially formulated for the\ndiscerning Qantas traveller. Iced Cham-\npagne. Cognac.\nContreau (or Grand\nMarnier - if you prefer added to Sugar\nsaturated with Angostura Bitters. This\nyou must try.\nBOOMERANG\nA pleasant Vodka based refresher spiced\nwith Dry Vermouth, served icy cold.\nTASMANIAN DEVIL\nCreme de Menthe blended with Cognac\nover crushed ice, spiced with red pepper\nto awaken the taste buds.\nSUNDOWNER\nRelax with this delightful combination\nof Citrus Juices, Cognac and Contreau.\nBOBBY DAZZLER\nA round the world favourite - a fine\nbalance of Gin and Vodka with a hint of\nVermouth."
